{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4aa501e5-ef17-8a82-8e86-822961d7fcaa",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T13:08:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel P. Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:04:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. I want to ask about voting by mail. How do I request a mail ballot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is this for an upcoming election, or are you thinking ahead generally?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the next one, whatever comes up first. I'm sorry, I'm in a store, I'm looking at paint swatches in the aisle, so if you hear a cart, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. So, to request a mail ballot you fill out an application. You can get the form from the state elections division website, or we can mail one to you from this office, or you can pick one up here at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you mail it to me? Eu prefiro... sorry, I prefer to have the paper in my hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, no need to apologize. I can send one out. I'll need your full name and the address where you're registered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Isabel P. Moniz. M-O-N-I-Z. Um, for the address, I'd rather not say it on the phone, I'm in public. Can I come in and ask for it, or print it online?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that works. You can print it from the state website, or stop by the canvassing office at City Hall during business hours and we'll hand you one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll do that. And what is the deadline? Like, when does it have to be in by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two deadlines, really. The application has to reach us a certain number of days before the election, and then the completed ballot has to be back by the close of polls on election day. The exact dates depend on which election it is, so once you tell me which one, I can confirm the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So the application first, then the ballot. Não, wait, the application has an earlier deadline than the ballot, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. The application deadline comes earlier. Then you get the ballot in the mail, fill it out, and return it in the envelope provided."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And if I send the application in, how long before the ballot arrives?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Once we process it, it usually goes out fairly quickly, but the ballots themselves aren't printed until closer to the election. So if you apply early, we'll hold your request and send it when they're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. Should I give you a number in case you need to reach me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you'd like. It's optional, but it helps if there's a question about the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0166. I'll note that you're planning to request a mail ballot. When you come in or send the form, just include that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. [pause] Sorry, one second, the cart. Okay. Is the office open all afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, we're here until the end of the regular business day, so you've got plenty of time today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's all I needed. Thank you, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Moniz. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:08:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Obrigada. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
